  "synopsis": [
    {
      "langue": "en",
      "text": "Sonic & Knuckles 5 (also known as Super Sonic 5 1997) Uses the same graphics sonic from Sonic the Hedgehog Pirate Hack, the theme song is reused from Sonic & Knuckles And also same as Sonic the Hedgehog Pirate Hack player starts Spring Yard Zone, likey the game based off Sonic the Hedgehog Pirate Hack."
    },
    {
      "langue": "de",
      "text": "Sonic & Knuckles 5 (auch bekannt als Super Sonic 5 1997) Verwendet die gleiche Grafik Sonic von Sonic the Hedgehog Pirate Hack, der Titelsong wird von Sonic & Knuckles wiederverwendet Und auch dasselbe wie Sonic the Hedgehog Pirate Hack Spieler startet Spring Yard Zone, wie das Spiel basierend auf Sonic the Hedgehog Pirate Hack."
    }
  ],
